1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,364
In a Juice Shop lab, six scanner alerts reveal one potential issue.

2
00:00:05,914 --> 00:00:11,319
Nikto and ZAP results are grouped, bringing the evidence together for review.

3
00:00:11,869 --> 00:00:17,791
The common evidence is a wildcard cross origin header, returned on multiple paths.

4
00:00:18,341 --> 00:00:25,616
AI assists the triage. Fixed policy gates constrain actions, and a human reviews the finding.

5
00:00:26,166 --> 00:00:33,276
The recorded report scores the proposed finding at four point three. This is not proof of exploitation.

6
00:00:33,826 --> 00:00:41,847
The recommended fix: allow only trusted origins, then test that untrusted origins receive no approval.
